      `we have such a registered agent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation have such a registered agent?
      `the person served is an officer, director or other agent of ours then in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person served an officer, director or other agent of the corporation then in Delaware?
