-- s 377. Changing the registered agent; reinstatement.
@export Has my qualified foreign corporation changed its registered agent (s 377(a))?
GIVEN `we have qualified to do business in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the foreign corporation qualified to do business in Delaware?
      `we filed the certificate with the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate filed with the Secretary of State?
      `the certificate was acknowledged in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate acknowledged in accordance with s 103?
      `it names the new registered agent and gives the agent's address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate set forth the name and address of the registered agent designated in Delaware upon whom process may be served?
      `it revokes all earlier appointments of an agent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the certificate set forth a revocation of all previous appointments of agent for such purposes?
      `the new agent is one s 371(b)(2)(i) allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the new registered agent one that s 371(b)(2)(i) allows?
