      `it sets forth our name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set forth the name of the foreign corporation?
      `it sets forth the effective date of the forfeiture` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set forth the effective date of the forfeiture?
      `it sets forth the name and address of the registered agent s 132 requires` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set forth the name and address of the registered agent required to be maintained by s 132?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
