    `s 377(d) the foreign corporation has filed a proper certificate of reinstatement` `our qualification was forfeited under s 132(f)(4) or s 136(b)` `we filed a certificate of reinstatement with the Secretary of State` `it was acknowledged in accordance with s 103` `it sets forth our name` `it sets forth the effective date of the forfeiture` `it sets forth the name and address of the registered agent s 132 requires`

@export Is my foreign corporation's qualification to do business reinstated as if it had not been forfeited (s 377(e))?
