-- s 382. Service on a foreign corporation that did not qualify.
@export Is the Secretary of State my foreign corporation's agent for the acceptance of legal process in this action (s 382(a))?
GIVEN `where my corporation is organized` IS A `Where an entity is formed` @desc Under whose law is the corporation organized: Delaware, another US jurisdiction, or a jurisdiction outside the United States?
      `we have qualified to do business under s 371` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the foreign corporation qualified to do business under s 371?
      `we transact business in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the foreign corporation transact business in Delaware (carry on business activities here, including soliciting business or orders)?
      `the action is a civil action in a state or federal court in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action a civil action, suit or proceeding against the corporation in a state or federal court in Delaware?
      `the action arises out of business we transacted in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the action arise or grow out of business the corporation transacted within Delaware?
      `we consented in writing to the jurisdiction of a Delaware court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the corporation consent in writing to be subject to the jurisdiction of a state or federal court in Delaware for a civil action, suit or proceeding?
      `the action arises out of the business or matter we consented about` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the action arise or grow out of the business or matter to which the consent relates?
      `the consent agreement provides no manner of service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the agreement or instrument setting forth the consent provide no manner of service of legal process?
      `we are an insurance company doing business in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation an insurance company doing business in Delaware?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is the Secretary of State my foreign corporation's agent for the acceptance of legal process in this action` IF
    `s 382(a) the Secretary of State is the foreign corporation's agent for the acceptance of legal process in the action`
        (`s 382(a) the corporation is deemed to have appointed the Secretary of State its agent by transacting business without qualifying` `where my corporation is organized` `we have qualified to do business under s 371` `we transact business in Delaware` `the action is a civil action in a state or federal court in Delaware` `the action arises out of business we transacted in Delaware`)
        (`s 382(a) the corporation is deemed to have appointed the Secretary of State its agent by consenting in writing to jurisdiction` `where my corporation is organized` `we consented in writing to the jurisdiction of a Delaware court` `the action arises out of the business or matter we consented about` `the consent agreement provides no manner of service`)
        (`s 382(b) this section applies to the corporation` `we are an insurance company doing business in Delaware`)

