    `s 383(a) the foreign corporation is barred from maintaining the action or special proceeding in this State` `we are required to comply with ss 371 and 372` `we have done business in Delaware without authority` `we have since been authorized to do business in Delaware` `we have paid the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for the years we did business without authority` `the plaintiff is a successor in interest of the foreign corporation`

DECLARE `What a foreign corporation's failure to get authority leaves intact` IS ONE OF
    `the validity of its contracts and acts, under s 383(b)`
    `the other party's right to sue on its contract, under s 383(b)`
    `its right to defend an action or special proceeding in Delaware, under s 383(b)`

@export Does my foreign corporation's failure to obtain authority to do business impair this (s 383(b))?
GIVEN `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the foreign corporation fail to obtain authority to do business in Delaware?
      thing IS A `What a foreign corporation's failure to get authority leaves intact` @desc What do you want to know about: the validity of the corporation's contracts and acts, the other party's right to sue on its contract, or its right to defend an action or special proceeding in Delaware?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does my foreign corporation's failure to obtain authority to do business impair this` IS
    CONSIDER thing
    WHEN `the validity of its contracts and acts, under s 383(b)` THEN `s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority impairs the validity of a contract or act of the foreign corporation` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in Delaware`
    WHEN `the other party's right to sue on its contract, under s 383(b)` THEN `s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority impairs the right of the other party to the contract to maintain an action or special proceeding on it` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in Delaware`
    WHEN `its right to defend an action or special proceeding in Delaware, under s 383(b)` THEN `s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority prevents the foreign corporation from defending an action or special proceeding in this State` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in Delaware`

